      "id": "claim_0ed48737ad97483f9e514745cacd6cf2",
      "statement": "Error handling in the application involves detection via media element events, HLS error events, play() promise rejections, and global handlers (window.onerror/unhandledrejection in the renderer, process unhandledRejection/uncaughtException in the Electron main process), centralized structured logging with ErrorCode codes in src/js/errors.js, automatic retry with exponential backoff (base * 2^attempt, MAX_RETRIES = 3) for audio reconnects and HLS network errors, and user feedback via the shared status indicator.",
