    {
      "id": "claim_f06fb7b2851c4cfbb2bcd3077a22ce15",
      "statement": "src/js/errors.js is the single shared error/logging hub for both the renderer and the Electron main process: it defines the frozen ErrorCode taxonomy (27 codes grouped by storage, metadata, media/autoplay, HLS, electron file/navigation, player/reconnect, favorites, media session, download history, and global domains) plus HlsErrorMap, exposes leveled loggers logError/logWarn/logInfo/logDebug via window.* and module.exports, and is require()d by electron/main.js which calls initMainProcessErrorHandlers() at startup.",
