      "id": "claim_56638c9764a34e5bb0201cd1190e7be0",
      "statement": "logStorageError types localStorage failures via getStorageErrorType as QUOTA_EXCEEDED (QuotaExceededError or legacy code 22), SECURITY_ERROR, or UNKNOWN, and logs them with {key, type} at error level; PlayerCore's readSetting/writeSetting/readJSON/writeJSON/removeSetting form the single try/catch storage boundary and report through the defensive logStorageErrorSafe, which resolves window.logStorageError lazily and falls back to console.error.",
