      "statement": "Global handlers log errors that escape component handling: in the renderer initGlobalErrorHandlers (auto-invoked when window exists) sets window.onerror to log UNHANDLED_ERROR with source/lineno/colno and listens for 'unhandledrejection' to log UNHANDLED_REJECTION; in the Electron main process initMainProcessErrorHandlers registers process.on('unhandledRejection') and process.on('uncaughtException') with the same codes.",
