      "id": "claim_1745dd46169b427ca6bdffce7cfb9d94",
      "statement": "The audio player recovers from a media error event by logging PLAYER_MEDIA_ERROR (with MediaError code/message, src, page) and scheduling retryAudio via PlayerCore.scheduleRetry with exponential backoff getRetryDelay = base * 2^attempt (1000/2000/4000 ms) up to MAX_RETRIES = 3; exhaustion logs AUDIO_RECONNECT_FAILED and shows a persistent error status, and an 'online' event triggers an immediate retry counted as one attempt.",
