      "id": "claim_0ad57ca1d1524be7820e136b82ae897d",
      "statement": "The video page classifies Hls.Events.ERROR data through window.HlsErrorMap (NETWORK_ERROR/MEDIA_ERROR/KEY_ERROR/MUX_ERROR to HLS_* codes), logging HLS_FATAL for fatal and ErrorCode['HLS_' + mappedType] otherwise; fatal network errors trigger handleNetworkRetry with startLoad() retries and the same exponential backoff (destroying the HLS instance and showing a persistent message after 3 attempts), fatal media errors call recoverMediaError(), and all other fatal errors destroy the HLS instance and show 'Schwerwiegender Fehler' via the status display.",
