    {
      "id": "claim_c1d99f10bec3432ea6dda036c5870b92",
      "statement": "The Electron main process confines the custom file protocol to the app directory: a resolved path outside appDir logs PATH_TRAVERSAL and returns a 403 JSON body, while ENOENT/EACCES/EPERM and other fs or net failures log FILE_REQUEST and return 404/403/500 JSON; navigation guards on will-navigate/will-redirect/will-frame-navigate/setWindowOpenHandler route http(s)/mailto to shell.openExternal (logging INVALID_NAVIGATION_URL on failure) and load discovered subpages or fall back to index.html, and page discovery plus .npmignore read failures log PAGE_DISCOVERY and NPMIGNORE_READ.",
